  "title": "Qt: Preserve simple dialog secondary message when queueing messages",
  "description": "Creating the SimpleDialog and then setting the secondary text later\ndoesn't work when the app is still initializing and queuing all the\nmessages to show later. It ends up dropping the secondary message.\n\nPass the secondary message as an optional parameter to the constructor.\n\nDo the trimming and cleanup of the primary and secondary messages before\nqueueing them. Only create the MessagePair struct if we're queueing\nthem, and construct it in place.",
